-- World fixes: Burning Steppes zone review (zone 46, map 0), 2026-11-27
-- Four, flying from the Explorers' League Digsite to Flamestar Post: crazy amounts of overspawns, a lot of spawns
-- with 2 or 3 extra copies, and a whole Blackrock army below the flight path.
-- Reference: TDB 8.3.7. Same rules as the earlier zone reviews: critters and wild battle pets are never touched;
-- spawns linked to events, pools, formations, paths or scripts are kept; nothing that stands next to a hostile NPC
-- is removed or stopped; no new spawn next to a town NPC. Quest rule (Four, 2026-11-20): quest givers are never
-- removed, and a quest target or quest-loot mob never drops below the 8.3.7 count.
-- Run after 2026_11_27_30. Safe to run twice.
-- 1. extra creatures (each TDB spawn keeps its nearest match, unmatched extras go down to the TDB count; plus exact doubles): 271 (Greater Obsidian Elemental 41, Black Wyrmkin 37, Venomtip Scorpid 24, Black Dragonspawn 22, Giant Ember Worg 21, Ember Worg 14, Flamekin Spitter 14, Flamekin Torcher 13, Flamekin Rager 12, Blackrock Warlock 8, Obsidian Elemental 7, Thaurissan Firewalker 7, Firegut Reaver 6, Blackrock War Kodo 6, War Reaver 6, Blackrock Sorcerer 6, Firegut Ogre Mage 5, Blackrock Slayer 5, Thaurissan Agent 5, Firegut Brute 4, Smolderthorn Shaman 2, Fettered Red Whelpling 2, Minyoth 2, Ner'gosh the Shadow 1, Blackrock Invader 1)
